    ('low', '04', 'General Work at Height', '08', 'Is fall restraint/positioning system properly configured (harness and static line to 15kN-rated roof anchors, restraining worker from edge, tested and tagged per AS5532, AS/NZS 1891, current inspection tags) (WHS Reg cl.80)?', 'Check fall restraint systems are correctly installed and certified'),
    ('low', '04', 'General Work at Height', '09', 'Is fall arrest system properly configured (harness + shock-absorbing lanyard to 15kN-rated roof anchor, tested and tagged per AS5532, AS/NZS 1891, current inspection tags) (WHS Reg cl.80)?', 'Check fall arrest systems are correctly installed and certified'),
