    ('low', '06', 'Rope Access', '08', 'Is there an equipment register with unique ID, equipment type, model, serial number, date in service and next inspection date for all items used to support a person at height (NSW WHS Reg cl 235, 80, 39)?', 'Check equipment register is maintained and current'),
