    ('high', '04', 'General Work at Height', '06', 'Are access ladders/stairs secured, extend 1m above landing, set on firm base, and not within 2m of edge/void (WHS Reg cl.78)?', 'Inspect ladder access for compliance and safe positioning'),
    ('high', '04', 'General Work at Height', '07', 'Are A-frame ladders used only when no safer method is practicable (light-duty, short-duration tasks <10 minutes, fully opened with spreaders locked)?', 'Verify stepladders are appropriate for task or if platform ladder is better option'),
    ('high', '04', 'General Work at Height', '08', 'Is fall restraint/positioning system properly configured (harness and static line to 15kN-rated roof anchors, restraining worker from edge, tested and tagged per AS5532, AS/NZS 1891, current inspection tags) (WHS Reg cl.80)?', 'Check fall restraint systems are correctly installed and certified'),
    ('high', '04', 'General Work at Height', '09', 'Is fall arrest system properly configured (harness + shock-absorbing lanyard to 15kN-rated roof anchor, tested and tagged per AS5532, AS/NZS 1891, current inspection tags) (WHS Reg cl.80)?', 'Check fall arrest systems are correctly installed and certified'),
    ('high', '04', 'General Work at Height', '10', 'Are fall restraint/arrest systems designed, installed and verified by qualified person before use, and inspected within 12 months by Height Safety Inspector?', 'Verify height safety systems have been professionally designed and inspected'),
    ('high', '04', 'General Work at Height', '11', 'Are all high-risk records readily accessible and digitally auditable at time of audit (WHS Reg s.317)?', 'Verify work at height records are available for inspection'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '01', 'Has scaffolding been erected by HRW licensed person, certified/tagged (green) after inspection per AS/NZS 1576 and AS 4576, and re-inspected within last 30 days (WHS Reg s.317)?', 'Check scaffold is erected by licensed person with current certification'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '02', 'Is scaffold appropriately supported on ground?', 'Verify scaffold base plates and foundations are adequate'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '03', 'Are working decks complete with no missing ledgers, planks or hop-ups?', 'Inspect scaffold platforms for completeness and integrity'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '04', 'Are handrails and mid-rails installed?', 'Check scaffold edge protection rails are in place'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '05', 'Are toe boards/brick guards installed?', 'Verify toe boards prevent falling objects'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '06', 'Are ties installed vertically every 4mt (or 3mt for heavy-duty scaffolds)?', 'Check vertical tie spacing meets requirements'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '07', 'Are ties installed horizontally minimum every second bay?', 'Check horizontal tie spacing meets requirements'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '08', 'Is adequate diagonal bracing installed?', 'Verify scaffold has sufficient bracing for stability'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '09', 'Is safe access/egress to scaffold decks provided?', 'Check proper access is provided to all working levels'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '10', 'Are gaps between working deck and building edges less than 225mm?', 'Measure gaps to ensure they don''t create fall hazards'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '11', 'Are materials or debris kept â‰¥2mt from unprotected edges to avoid trip-and-fall hazards?', 'Check housekeeping near edges is maintained'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '12', 'Are loads placed on scaffold within its rated capacity?', 'Verify scaffold loading does not exceed design limits'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '13', 'Has scaffold ONLY been altered by HRW licensed scaffolder?', 'Confirm only licensed scaffolders have modified the scaffold'),
    ('high', '05', 'Scaffolding', '14', 'Is access to scaffold towers controlled during work hours (door closed with signage) and secured after hours (locked or otherwise secured) (WHS Reg Cls 225 & 226)?', 'Check unauthorised access prevention measures are in place'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '01', 'Is there a SWMS for rope access (WHS Reg cl.34-36, cl.299)?', 'Verify rope access SWMS is documented and available'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '02', 'Do rope access workers hold current IRATA/SPRAT or equivalent competency appropriate for task level?', 'Check rope access workers have current certification'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '03', 'Have workers been consulted on anchor locations, descent path, edge protection, communication, emergency and rescue plan and exclusion zones?', 'Verify worker consultation on rope access planning has occurred'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '04', 'Is there a documented emergency and rescue plan with equipment and trained personnel available for pick-off or lowering rescue (WHS Reg cl.80)?', 'Check emergency rescue plan and resources are in place'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '05', 'Are workers using full-body harness with fall-arrest and work-positioning attachment points (AS/NZS 1891.1) plus helmets with chinstraps, long sleeve hi-viz shirt, safety gloves, eye protection, hearing protection, safety shoes?', 'Verify rope access workers have appropriate harness and PPE'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '06', 'Are anchor systems designed, tested and tagged to AS/NZS 5532 (static strength â‰¥15kN) with current certification (â‰¤12 months)?', 'Check anchor point certification is current'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '07', 'Are industrial-grade ropes and equipment to AS/NZS 1891 series and AS/NZS 4488 used with two-rope system (main + safety line) with descender and backup device?', 'Verify rope access equipment meets standards and is correctly configured'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '08', 'Is there an equipment register with unique ID, equipment type, model, serial number, date in service and next inspection date for all items used to support a person at height (NSW WHS Reg cl 235, 80, 39)?', 'Check equipment register is maintained and current'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '09', 'Is edge management in place (padding or rollers at parapets to prevent rope damage; fall-object protection for tools/paint pots) (WHS Reg cl.54)?', 'Verify edge protection and drop prevention measures are in place'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '10', 'Are exclusion zones established (barricade ground level to protect public from falling objects or overspray; signage "Rope Access Above â€“ Keep Clear")?', 'Check ground level is barricaded and signposted'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '11', 'Is weather being monitored (cease work in high wind, lightning, heavy rain; monitor for sudden changes) (WHS Reg cl.40)?', 'Verify weather monitoring and work stoppage protocols are followed'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '12', 'Have building occupants been notified and is access management confirmed?', 'Check public interface and notification requirements are met'),
    ('high', '06', 'Rope Access', '13', 'Are all high-risk records readily accessible and digitally auditable at time of audit (WHS Reg s.317)?', 'Verify rope access records are available for inspection'),
    ('high', '07', 'Plant and Equipment Safety', '01', 'Is electrical equipment inspected, tested and tagged (WHS Reg cl.150)?', 'Check electrical items have current test and tag'),
    ('high', '07', 'Plant and Equipment Safety', '02', 'Are guards on machinery or tools where there is risk of injury (WHS Regulation Part 3.1)?', 'Verify machine guarding is in place and effective'),
    ('high', '07', 'Plant and Equipment Safety', '03', 'Is daily pre-start completed by plant operators (e.g. swing stage scaffold/EWP/excavator) who hold relevant HRW licence or VOC (WHS Reg Part 4.5)?', 'Check pre-start inspections are documented by competent operators'),
    ('high', '07', 'Plant and Equipment Safety', '04', 'Are periodic maintenance inspections recorded as per OEM (Original Equipment Manufacturer) requirements (WHS Reg Part 4.5 cls 213-215)?', 'Verify maintenance records are current per manufacturer specifications'),
    ('high', '07', 'Plant and Equipment Safety', '05', 'Is EWP used only as working platform (not for access/egress)?', 'Check EWP is being used correctly as work platform only'),
    ('high', '07', 'Plant and Equipment Safety', '06', 'Are all high-risk records readily accessible and digitally auditable at time of audit (WHS Reg s.317)?', 'Verify plant and equipment records are available for inspection'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '01', 'Are all hazardous products on site (primers, membranes, adhesives, sealants, cleaners) identified and recorded in a register (WHS Reg cl.346)?', 'Check hazardous substances register is maintained and current'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '02', 'Are current Safety Data Sheets (SDS) (â‰¤5 years old) readily accessible for each chemical including water-based paint or membranes (WHS Reg cl.344)?', 'Verify SDS are current and accessible for all chemicals'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '03', 'Are minimum controls for silica in place (grinder with LEV, M-class HEPA-filtered vacuum, P2 respirator fit-tested, exclusion zone, SWMS covering silica controls) (SafeWork NSW Respirable Crystalline Silica CoP 2025)?', 'Check engineering controls for silica dust are implemented'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '04', 'If engineering controls are not available or practicable, has SWMS been updated to reflect alternative controls (e.g. support worker with M-class vacuum or fine water mist spray) (WHS Reg Cls 34-38, 49, 299)?', 'Verify alternative silica controls are documented in SWMS when engineering controls unavailable'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '05', 'Is respiratory protection fit-for-purpose (e.g. P2 for silica), fit-tested, issued, maintained per AS/NZS 1715 and 1716?', 'Check respiratory protection program is properly implemented'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '06', 'Are housekeeping and cleaning using wet methods or M-class vacuum (AS/NZS 60335.2.69)?', 'Verify cleaning methods prevent dust generation'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '07', 'Is airborne dust monitoring conducted if there is uncertainty about control effectiveness (WHS Reg cl.49; SafeWork NSW Respirable Crystalline Silica CoP 2025)?', 'Check if exposure monitoring is required and conducted'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '08', 'Are chemical storage and handling practices compliant (bunding or trays under liquids; lids kept closed; incompatible substances segregated per AS 1940)?', 'Verify chemical storage arrangements meet safety standards'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '09', 'If suspect ACM is found, is work stopped and assessment by competent person arranged with removal only by licensed contractor per How to Safely Remove Asbestos CoP and WHS Reg Part 8?', 'Check asbestos management procedures are understood and followed'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '10', 'If lead-based paint is present, is it managed per Lead Risk Work Code of Practice (NSW) and AS 4361.2?', 'Verify lead paint management procedures are in place if applicable'),
    ('high', '08', 'Hazardous Substances and Silica Control', '11', 'Are all high-risk records readily accessible and digitally auditable at time of audit (WHS Reg s.317)?', 'Verify hazardous substance records are available for inspection'),
    ('high', '09', 'Demolition and Temporary Works', '01', 'Is demolition work conducted per WHS Reg 2017 Part 4.6 and AS 2601 covering planning, licensing, hazard identification, services isolation, structural stability, work area protection and mobile plant (Demolition of Structures)?', 'Check demolition planning and execution meets regulatory requirements'),
    ('high', '09', 'Demolition and Temporary Works', '02', 'Are temporary props/braces/shoring installed where needed and verified by engineering certifications (AS 2601)?', 'Verify temporary structural supports are engineered and certified'),
    ('high', '09', 'Demolition and Temporary Works', '03', 'Has a structural engineer completed inspection and certification that Type B (overhead protection) hoarding has been constructed and maintained per its design (SafeWork NSW CoP: Overhead Protective Structures 2020)?', 'Check overhead protection is engineered, certified and maintained'),
    ('high', '09', 'Demolition and Temporary Works', '04', 'Are all high-risk records readily accessible and digitally auditable at time of audit (WHS Reg s.317)?', 'Verify demolition and temporary works records are available for inspection'),
    ('high', '10', 'Energy and Services', '01', 'Are energy sources identified (all electrical, hydraulic, pneumatic, gas, water, or stored-energy hazards located and recorded)?', 'Check energy source identification and documentation is complete'),
    ('high', '10', 'Energy and Services', '02', 'Is equipment shut down safely (machines/plant switched off using normal stop controls before isolation)?', 'Verify safe shutdown procedures are followed'),
    ('high', '10', 'Energy and Services', '03', 'Are isolation points secured (main switches, valves or disconnects physically locked in "off/closed" position)?', 'Check lockout/tagout procedures are properly implemented')
